Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := 금고 새로: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault 암호화: message 키: key.
>> decrypted := vault 복호화: encrypted 키: key.

출력 
쓰기: ['Message:'], 줄바꿈
쓰기: message, 줄바꿈
쓰기: ['Decrypted:'], 줄바꿈
쓰기: decrypted, 줄바꿈.
